# broadcom-wl Arch depolarindan dusuruldu; DKMS surumu kaldi.
# Modulun ISO icinde derlenebilmesi icin dkms de gerekli (linux-headers zaten listede).
# NOTE: wl.ko's PCI alias is a wildcard (any class-0280 network controller), so
# udev used to load this proprietary, unsigned module on Intel-WiFi machines too
# — tainting the kernel and disabling the return-thunk mitigation. maze-hardening
# (>= 1.0.0-4) blacklists it and loads it via udev only when a Broadcom (14e4)
# controller is present. Keep both packages in sync if this is ever changed.
broadcom-wl-dkms
dkms
btrfs-progs
clonezilla
